export const title = "Exclusion Area";
export const html = "<h1>Exclusion Area</h1>\n      <hr class=\"rule\" />\n      <p>If the same type of false detection keeps occurring at the same location, you can use an exclusion area to filter it out.</p>\n      <p>Objects that appear inside an added exclusion area are ignored and do not trigger events.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n      <div class=\"app-window\">\n        <div class=\"app-body\" style=\"min-height:auto;\">\n          <div class=\"app-sidebar-nav\" style=\"width:170px;\">\n            <div class=\"grp\">Video</div>\n            <div class=\"item\">Video Input &#9662;</div>\n            <div class=\"item\" style=\"padding-left:26px;\">Video Stream</div>\n            <div class=\"item active\" style=\"padding-left:26px;\">Detection Filter</div>\n            <div class=\"item\">Output &#9656;</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"app-main\">\n            <div class=\"app-breadcrumb\">Home / Video Input / Detection Filter</div>\n            <div class=\"app-h\">Detection Filter</div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n              <span class=\"btn small\">Min Size Filter</span><span class=\"btn small\">Max Size Filter</span><span class=\"btn small primary\">Exclusion Area</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"app-panel\"><strong style=\"font-size:12.5px;\">Exclusion Area</strong></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <figcaption>Video Input &rarr; Detection Filter &rarr; Exclusion Area</figcaption>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>Click <strong>Exclusion Area</strong> in the sidebar menu to open the setting screen.</p>\n      <p>Select the channel you want to configure an exclusion area for.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:220px;\">\n        <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:6px 10px;\">\n          <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:1fr;font-size:12.5px;\">\n            <select disabled><option>CH 1</option><option>CH 2</option><option>CH 3</option><option>CH 4</option><option>CH 5</option><option>CH 6</option><option>CH 7</option></select>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>Clicking the <span class=\"btn small primary\">+ Add Zone</span> button creates an exclusion area box in the video area. Up to 10 exclusion areas can be configured per channel.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:520px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\">\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\" fill=\"url(#streetgrad)\"/>\n          <defs>\n            <linearGradient id=\"streetgrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n              <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8a9bab\"/>\n              <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#4a5a68\"/>\n            </linearGradient>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#1b2430\" opacity=\"0.75\" stroke=\"#0b0f19\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"25\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1b2430\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"25\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1b2430\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1b2430\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1b2430\"/>\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"230\" width=\"500\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#8a8f92\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"255\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#2b3038\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"270\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#3a4048\"/>\n          <rect x=\"230\" y=\"200\" width=\"14\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#3a4048\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption>Dragging out a new exclusion area box over the video</figcaption>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>How to Configure an Exclusion Area</h2>\n      <p>Drag inside an exclusion area to move its position.</p>\n      <p>Drag from a corner handle of the exclusion area to resize it.</p>\n      <p>Double-click or right-click an exclusion area to delete it.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"figure\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--green);background:#fafbfc;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;\">&#8251; Note</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 4px;\">To avoid unintentionally filtering out real objects, keep exclusion areas as small as possible.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0;\">An object is excluded whenever its <strong>center point</strong> falls inside an exclusion area \u2014 even if the object's full bounding box isn't entirely contained within it.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2>Saving, Loading, and Resetting Settings</h2>\n      <p>Click the <span class=\"btn small primary\">Apply</span> button at the bottom of the screen to save the exclusion area settings configured in the video area.</p>\n      <p>Click the <span class=\"btn small\">Cancel</span> button to load the last saved exclusion area settings for the selected channel.</p>\n      <p>Click the <span class=\"btn small\">Reset</span> button at the bottom left to clear and reset every exclusion area setting for the selected channel.</p>";
